      {
        "id": "E0",
        "kind": "feed",
        "text": "Anthropic is an AI safety and research company that's working to build reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "• • • • • • • • • Introducing the Anthropic Cyber Mission \\ Anthropic • • • • • •",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today we’re launching the Anthropic Cyber Mission, a long-term commitment to securing the systems everyone depends on.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Cyber Mission is a new effort to support defenders with tools, research, and resources to secure their software and systems.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We will also expand the Cyber Mission to release tools, research, and resources in new areas to help secure the world.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "And through the Anthropic Cyber Mission, we’ll deploy Anthropic engineering talent and provide tools and funding for those who secure critical infrastructure and open-source software.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Through our work with critical infrastructure organizations, PwC’s cyber OT practice has seen firsthand the gravity of consequences cyber breaches can have in these environments.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "By combining Unit 42 threat intelligence and operational expertise with Anthropic’s frontier models, we’re helping operators defend against adversaries looking to attack and disrupt essential services.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Through participation in this program, we look forward to collaborating with Anthropic and fellow partners to further enhance cyber resilience for critical infrastructure.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We expect a true-positive rate above 90%, and will work to improve the true positive rate and fix quality over time.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This will take years and we expect the Anthropic Cyber Mission to change as we, together with the public and private sector, learn what works.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Anthropic is committing $150 million over three years to the Genesis Mission, a federal initiative to accelerate scientific and technological discovery through AI.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re launching a new, expanded version of our Cyber Verification Program, which makes advanced cyber capabilities and reduced blocking classifiers available to qualifying security professionals.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/anthropic-cyber-mission",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T09:04:16.632Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:17.595Z"
      }
    ],
